    body: 'The timing of MTP is one of the most important factors that affects the method, complexity, cost, and recovery. Here is a clear comparison of first and second trimester abortion in India.\n\nFirst Trimester Abortion (Up to 12 Weeks)\n\nFirst trimester abortion is the safest and simplest option. Up to 9 weeks medical abortion pills can be used — non-invasive, no surgery, can be managed at home. Between 9 and 12 weeks surgical Suction and Evacuation (S&E or MVA) is the gold standard — 10 to 15 minutes under local anaesthesia, same-day discharge, virtually 100% complete.\n\nCost: Rs 3,000 to Rs 15,000 depending on method and city.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nSecond Trimester Abortion (12 to 20 Weeks)\n\nSecond trimester abortion requires more planning and preparation. Between 12 and 16 weeks D&E (Dilation and Evacuation) or D&C combined with cervical preparation is used. Between 16 and 20 weeks medical induction combined with surgical evacuation is typically used.\n\nSecond trimester procedures require more preparation, take longer, may require an overnight stay, and have a slightly higher complication risk. However they are still safe when performed by experienced gynaecologists at registered hospitals.\n\nCost: Rs 12,000 to Rs 25,000 depending on gestational age, method, and hospital.\n\nExpert Doctor for This Procedure\\n\\nDr. Geeta Chadha (MS (OBG), FICOG) — 24 years of experience — practices at Max Hospital, Delhi. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 to book a consultation with Dr. Geeta Chadha or a similar expert in your city.\n\nWhy Seek MTP Early?\n\nEarlier is always better. First trimester procedures are simpler, less expensive, faster, involve less recovery, and have lower risk. If you are considering MTP do not delay. Call MySurgery immediately at 8588967050 for same-day or next-day appointments.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nSpecial Cases for Second Trimester MTP\n\nSome women discover pregnancy late due to irregular periods, hormonal conditions, or lack of symptoms. Late foetal abnormalities are sometimes diagnosed only at 16 to 20 weeks anomaly scan. Rape survivors who take time to process and seek help. All these situations are legally covered under the MTP Act 2021.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050',
