    quickAnswer: 'Phimosis treatment in India costs Rs 12,000 to Rs 45,000. Laser or ZSR circumcision is the most effective permanent cure. Preputioplasty (foreskin widening) is a less radical option. Steroid creams can help mild phimosis. Most cases require surgery for a permanent cure.',
