    title: "Circumcision Cost Breakdown in India 2026 — What You Are Actually Paying For",
    excerpt: "Circumcision Cost Breakdown in India 2026 — What You Are Actually Paying For — Expert guide with costs, legal information, doctor insights, and free consultation.",
    date: "2026-04-01",
    author: "Dr. Anant Kumar",
    authorTitle: "MCh (Urology), FRCS, 30 years experience, Max Hospital Delhi",
    category: "Urology",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    quickAnswer: 'Circumcision total cost includes surgeon fee (35-45%), OT charges (20-25%), anaesthesia (10-15%), consumables (10-15%), hospital bed charge (0-10%), and medicines (5-8%). Understanding each component helps you compare quotes and make informed decisions.',
    procedure: "Circumcision (Laser/ZSR)",
    keywords: ["cost-breakdown-circumcision-india-2026", "Circumcision Cost Breakdown in India 2026 — What You Are Act"],
    body: "When you get a circumcision quote from a hospital understanding what each component includes helps you compare options intelligently. Here is a complete cost breakdown.\n\nSurgeon Fee — 35 to 45% of Total Cost\n\nThis is the largest component. Senior urologists with 15 to 20 years of experience charge Rs 8,000 to Rs 20,000. More experienced consultants and directors charge Rs 15,000 to Rs 25,000. For laser circumcision the surgeon's skill directly affects the cosmetic outcome and healing.\n\nOT Charges — 20 to 25% of Total Cost\n\nOperation Theatre charges include OT time (typically 30 to 45 minutes for circumcision), sterilisation of instruments, OT nursing staff, and OT consumables (drapes, gowns). In corporate hospitals OT charges are higher than in standalone clinics.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nAnaesthesia — 10 to 15% of Total Cost\n\nAdult circumcision under local anaesthesia: anaesthesia cost is low (Rs 1,500 to Rs 3,000 for local anaesthetic drugs). Child circumcision under general anaesthesia: anaesthesiologist fee plus medicines (Rs 5,000 to Rs 12,000). This is why child circumcision is more expensive than adult circumcision.\n\nConsumables — 10 to 15% of Total Cost\n\nFor laser circumcision: laser probe tip, sterile drapes, sutures (minimal). For ZSR circumcision: ZSR device itself (Rs 3,000 to Rs 5,000), sterile drapes. For conventional circumcision: sutures, sterile drapes, wound dressing.\n\nExpert Doctor for This Procedure\\n\\nDr. Anant Kumar (MCh (Urology), FRCS) — 30 years of experience — practices at Max Hospital, Delhi. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 to book a consultation with Dr. Anant Kumar or a similar expert in your city.\n\nMedicines — 5 to 8% of Total Cost\n\nAntibiotics (usually a 5-day course), painkillers, antibiotic ointment for wound care.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nWhat Is NOT Included in Most Quotes\n\nPre-operative blood tests (CBC, PT/INR if required): Rs 500 to Rs 1,500. Pre-operative consultation if separate from surgical fee: Rs 500 to Rs 1,000. Follow-up visits: usually 1 to 2 included in the package at MySurgery.\n\nMySurgery All-Inclusive Packages\n\nMySurgery offers all-inclusive circumcision packages that include consultation, ultrasound (if required), surgeon fee, OT charges, anaesthesia, consumables, medicines, dressings, and 2 follow-up visits. No hidden charges. The price you are quoted is the price you pay.\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 for a transparent cost quote for circumcision in your city.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050",
