    quickAnswer: "Inguinal hernia surgery in India costs Rs 40,000 to Rs 1,20,000. Laparoscopic TEP or TAPP repair costs Rs 55,000 to Rs 1,20,000. Open Lichtenstein repair costs Rs 35,000 to Rs 70,000. Insurance covers inguinal hernia surgery.",
