    quickAnswer: "Umbilical hernia surgery in India costs Rs 35,000 to Rs 90,000. Small umbilical hernias can be repaired without mesh (Mayo repair). Larger ones need mesh repair. Laparoscopic umbilical hernia repair is available at Rs 45,000 to Rs 90,000.",
