    keywords: ["umbilical-hernia-surgery-cost-india-2026", "Umbilical Hernia Surgery Cost in India 2026 — Treatment Guid"],
    body: "Umbilical Hernia Surgery in India \u2014 Complete Guide\n\nUmbilical hernia occurs at or near the belly button (navel). It is common in infants but also affects adults, especially those who are overweight, pregnant, or have had multiple pregnancies.\n\nWhat Is Umbilical Hernia?\n\nAn umbilical hernia happens when part of the intestine or fatty tissue pushes through a weak area in the abdominal muscles near the belly button. In adults it appears as a bulge near the navel that becomes more prominent when coughing, straining, or standing.\n\nWho Gets Umbilical Hernia?\n\nOverweight or obese individuals. Women during and after multiple pregnancies. People with chronic cough or constipation. People who do heavy manual work or lift heavy weights regularly. Those with chronic liver disease with ascites.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced hernia surgeon in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nTypes of Umbilical Hernia Repair in India\n\nPrimary suture repair (without mesh): For very small hernias under 1cm. Cost Rs 30,000 to Rs 60,000. Recurrence rate 10 to 30%.\n\nOpen mesh repair: For hernias 1cm to 4cm. Mesh placed under the abdominal wall. Cost Rs 35,000 to Rs 75,000. Recurrence rate below 5%.\n\nLaparoscopic mesh repair: For larger hernias or obese patients. 3 small incisions. Cost Rs 45,000 to Rs 90,000. Fastest recovery, lowest recurrence.\n\n\n\nExpert Surgeon Featured\n\nDr. Lokendra Kumar (MS General Surgery, FIAGES, FMAS) \u2014 20 years of experience \u2014 practices at Fortis Greater Noida, Noida. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 to book a consultation.\n\nUmbilical Hernia Surgery Cost by City\n\nDelhi: Rs 40,000 to Rs 85,000. Mumbai: Rs 50,000 to Rs 95,000. Bangalore: Rs 40,000 to Rs 85,000. Noida: Rs 35,000 to Rs 80,000. Chennai: Rs 35,000 to Rs 78,000. Tier-2 cities: Rs 25,000 to Rs 55,000.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced hernia surgeon in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nUmbilical Hernia in Infants\n\nIn infants under 2 years, umbilical hernias almost always close on their own. Surgery is only recommended if the hernia has not closed by age 4 to 5, or if there are complications. Never try to push the hernia back forcefully in infants without medical guidance.\n\nUmbilical Hernia During Pregnancy\n\nSmall umbilical hernias in pregnancy are usually managed conservatively until after delivery. Surgery is planned after delivery. Large or symptomatic hernias may rarely require surgery during pregnancy \u2014 always under specialist supervision.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced hernia surgeon in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050",
