    quickAnswer: "LASIK eye surgery in Delhi costs Rs 25,000 to Rs 95,000 per eye depending on the technology used. Bladeless LASIK costs Rs 30,000 to Rs 95,000. SMILE surgery costs Rs 33,000 to Rs 95,000. Same-day procedure, no hospitalisation.",
