    keywords: ["lasik-eye-surgery-cost-delhi-2026", "LASIK Eye Surgery Cost in Delhi 2026 — Complete Guide"],
    body: "LASIK Eye Surgery Cost in Delhi 2026\n\nDelhi has excellent eye care infrastructure with experienced refractive surgeons offering all LASIK technologies. Here is a complete cost guide.\n\nLASIK Cost in Delhi 2026\n\nStandard LASIK: Rs 25,000 to Rs 40,000 per eye. Basic laser vision correction. Less precise than newer technologies.\n\nBladeless LASIK (Femtosecond LASIK): Rs 30,000 to Rs 55,000 per eye. Uses two lasers for maximum precision. Most popular option.\n\nSMILE Surgery: Rs 33,000 to Rs 95,000 per eye. Latest technology. Flapless procedure. Excellent for dry eyes and active people.\n\nContoura Vision (Topography-guided LASIK): Rs 35,000 to Rs 95,000 per eye. Customised to your corneal shape. Best visual quality outcomes.\n\nPRK / LASEK: Rs 22,000 to Rs 45,000 per eye. Older technique. No flap \u2014 suitable for thin corneas.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced ophthalmologist in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nBest Hospitals for LASIK in Delhi\n\nCentre for Sight, leading NABH-accredited eye centres, Dr a leading eye hospital, Apollo Hospitals Delhi are among the leading eye care centres in Delhi for LASIK and refractive surgery.\n\n\n\nFeatured Eye Surgeon\n\nDr. Mahipal Sachdev (MS Ophthalmology, FRCS, FACS) \u2014 35 years of experience \u2014 Centre for Sight Delhi, Delhi. Call MySurgery at 8588967050 to book a consultation.\n\nAm I Eligible for LASIK in Delhi?\n\nYou are eligible if you are 18 years or older. Your spectacle prescription has been stable for at least 1 year. Your corneal thickness is adequate (typically above 480 to 500 microns). You have no other eye diseases such as keratoconus, glaucoma, or severe dry eyes. A pre-LASIK evaluation at any of our partner centres in Delhi will confirm your eligibility within 30 minutes.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced ophthalmologist in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050\n\nWhat Is Included in the LASIK Cost in Delhi?\n\nThe quoted cost typically includes the surgeon fee, laser usage charges, pre-operative evaluation on the day, wavefront analysis, and post-operative medicines for 1 month. Some centres include the pre-LASIK evaluation (Rs 500 to Rs 2,000) in the package. Some exclude it. Always ask what is included before booking.\n\nIs LASIK Permanent in Delhi?\n\nLASIK permanently reshapes your cornea. The effect is permanent. However your eyes can continue to change naturally with age. Most patients aged 18 to 40 who undergo LASIK maintain excellent vision for 20 or more years. After age 40 reading glasses may be needed for near work due to presbyopia \u2014 a natural ageing process unrelated to LASIK.\n\nRecovery After LASIK in Delhi\n\nVision improves within 24 hours for most patients. You can return to desk work the next day. Avoid swimming for 1 month. Avoid eye rubbing for 3 months. Most patients are glasses-free within 1 to 3 days.\n\n\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588967050 or WhatsApp us for a free consultation with an experienced ophthalmologist in your city. Callback within 30 minutes.\n\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588967050",
