    title: "Is Bypass Surgery Covered by Health Insurance in India? Complete Guide 2026",
    excerpt: "Everything you need to know about health insurance coverage for bypass surgery (CABG) in India — waiting periods, cashless claims, and how to maximise your benefit.",
    date: "2026-06-01",
