    title: "Ozempic Cuts Depression Risk by 44% and Anxiety by 38% — What Indian Patients Need to Know",
    excerpt: "A landmark Lancet Psychiatry study of 100,000 people found semaglutide dramatically reduces depression, anxiety, and substance use disorder. Here is what this means for Indian patients.",
    date: "2026-06-09",
    author: "MySurgery GLP-1 Team",
