    category: "GLP-1",
    readTime: "6 min read",
    quickAnswer: "A major Lancet Psychiatry study found semaglutide (Ozempic) reduces worsening depression by 44% and anxiety by 38%. Indian patients with obesity or diabetes may gain significant mental health benefits from GLP-1 therapy.",
