    excerpt: "Eli Lilly announced on June 9 that its once-daily GLP-1 pill orforglipron outperformed oral semaglutide in a Phase 3 diabetes trial. Here is what the needle-free future of GLP-1 therapy means for India.",
    date: "2026-06-11",
    author: "MySurgery GLP-1 Team",
